data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":109,"item_id":"msg_06b06d78d6ba3728016adb38dceb988191807995d50bf9f76a","output_index":1,"content_index":0,"text":"Corrected S002: for \\(k<j\\), \\(Y_{\\lambda-j}e_k\\) can be nonzero, but the projection \\(E_{\\lambda,\\lambda}\\) kills its image; for \\(k=j\\) it gives \\(\\binom{\\lambda}{j}e_\\lambda\\); for \\(k>j\\) it is zero. Thus the stated matrix-unit identity is for the composite.\n\nThe corrected candidate passed structural validation and was submitted. No Audit A was performed.","logprobs":[]}

